    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a> based on the provided list of <a href=\"Column.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Column</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "根据提供的<a href=\"Column.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>Column</code></a>列表创建一个<a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Expression</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a plain <code>sql</code> <a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个普通的<code>sql</code><a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Expression</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the list contains only a single column, this method returns that column directly as the resulting\n<a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a>. Otherwise, it creates and returns a <a href=\"TupleExpression.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>TupleExpression</code></a> that represents multiple columns as\na single expression.",
      "translation": "如果列表仅包含一列，则此方法直接返回该列作为结果<a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a>；否则，它创建并返回一个<a href=\"TupleExpression.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>TupleExpression</code></a>，该表达式代表多个列作为一个单一表达式。",
      "count": 1
    },
