    {
      "source": "an <a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>Expression</code></a> corresponding to the input columns: either a single column or a\n        <a href=\"TupleExpression.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>TupleExpression</code></a> for multiple columns.",
      "translation": "对应输入列的<a href=\"Expression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的接口\"><code>Expression</code></a>：单个列或\n        <a href=\"TupleExpression.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql 中的类\"><code>TupleExpression</code></a>（用于多列）。",
      "count": 1
